{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rake is a <strong>Singleplayer</strong> open-world survival horror game where you have to hunt down and kill the urban legend &quot;<strong>The Rake</strong>&quot;. You can use guns, melee weapons, beartraps, a handheld motion sensor, gun attachments, trailcams, medical equipment, food and anything else you can find to survive, defend yourself, and win against The Rake  while exploring or doing quests in the detailed and realistic open world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if you'd like to give me suggestions, feedback, ask me question, or just want keep up with new updates, announcements, trailers, and new screenshots join the <strong><i><u>Discord.</u></i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous Updates, New Content, &amp; Rake Improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Open-World with Locations filled with Lore &amp; Loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1+ Hour Long Main Quest/Campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night Cycle with Weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide Variety of Melee Weapons &amp; Guns like ARs, Pistols, SMGs, &amp; More </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment like Night Vision, Handheld Motion Sensor, Weapon Attachments, &amp; More</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deployable Beartraps &amp; Cameras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Desktop System with Flyable Drone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory System with Storage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main campaign takes place in Hells Valley National Park in Pennsylvania, which has been closed off to the public for years due to dozens of murders and unexplained disappearances. You have been invited by your friend to help him hunt The Rake after years of tracking down its home. You arrive only to find a blood stain, flashlight, and frantically written note. This is where the Main Quest picks up, which revolves around going from location to location searching for your friend while completing mini-objectives and having to defending yourself from The Rake along the way. It's  optional so if you want to just explore the map and kill the rake you can do that too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analog Horror:</strong>  <br><br>The game also has an analog horror series that takes place fully in-universe. The first season is currently on-going &amp; will give backstory/lore for the first campaign: <strong>Hells Valley National Park</strong> &amp; future seasons will focus on future maps and campaigns slowly building and expanding the world and universe. You can watch the full series as its coming out on the Kanoleiro <strong><u>YouTube</u></strong> channel with the link on the Steam sidebar.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kill The Rake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2668530/3f3f6c990eded792be6b4f99984191a2b71398c7.jpg"},{"name":"Find The Coil Gun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2668530/eb392bb4bf393283558417ac7f85c99cf3a1cf10.jpg"},{"name":"Complete The Hells Valley Campaign","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2668530/298b4fb1a756bec72c434216cc614ae06eec0815.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Quest V: The Lab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2668530/694003f05fee532b79ea1bbfb49969da0dd87b98.jpg"},{"name":"Get Thrown By The Rake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/26685