ke after years of tracking down its home. You arrive only to find a blood stain, flashlight, and frantically written note. This is where the Main Quest picks up, which revolves around going from location to location searching for your friend while completing mini-objectives and having to defending yourself from The Rake along the way. It's  optional so if you want to just explore the map and kill the rake you can do that too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analog Horror:</strong>  <br><br>The game also has an analog horror series that takes place fully in-universe. The first season is currently on-going &amp; will give backstory/lore for the first campaign: <strong>Hells Valley National Park</strong> &amp; future seasons will focus on future maps and campaigns slowly building and expanding the world and universe. You can watch the full series as its coming out on the Kanoleiro <strong><u>YouTube</u></strong> channel with the link on the Steam sidebar.</p>","developers":["Kanoleiro"],"dlc":[3099480],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668530/f898b2da0c97940413ee868e1ee82393fd00f2c8/header.jpg?t=1756744390","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257085117,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085117/movie480.mp4?t=1735343396","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085117/movie_max.mp4?t=1735343396"},"name":"The Rake | Official Trailer #2","thumbnai